# Verifies: SPEC §13 / D-DOC-01, D-DOC-02
# Confirms that multiple fenced blocks inside a single `##` doc comment are each counted
# individually as their own independent test case (D-DOC-02), and that a block tagged
# with a language (```json) is ignored as a test target (D-DOC-01).

## Adds two ints.
##
## ```
## assert(add(1, 2) == 3)
## ```
##
## Example output format (excluded as a test target because it has a language tag, D-DOC-01).
##
## ```json
## {"a": 1, "b": 2}
## ```
##
## Also confirmed with another addition pattern.
##
## ```
## assert(add(10, 20) == 30)
## ```
def add(a: int, b: int): int
    return a + b

print(add(1, 1))
